{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6893f4793aaa813084736488b475022dfb3c813fda4798aa3cd6525e3e1e22fb", "ja": "自分の事はワカラナイ……？", "zh": "自己也不太明白……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ea5a54bfc90c207d07f319b7a7d5979657dcbe0f4ebf35be24b7ba384b337de5", "ja": "次の地方公演の宣伝も兼ねて、雑誌の仕事を\n受けた一同。可憐はグラビア撮影に萎縮して\nしまうが、律子の指導で無事終了。その後、\n新曲の人選を思案中のプロデューサーは律子\nも候補に挙げるが、律子は冗談と受け取る。", "zh": "为了宣传接下来的地方公演，大家接下了杂志的工作。可怜因为要拍写真而有些畏缩，但在律子的指导下顺利完成了拍摄。之后，制作人在考虑新曲的人选时也把律子列为候选人，可律子却把这当成了玩笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "35993eb4c5cfd51c86c95d28af59f308084dcd94bec746be34cde71a0ca4c6f7", "ja": "（今日は雑誌の取材だ。地方公演の\nいい宣伝になる……みんな、頼んだぞ！）", "zh": "（今天要接受杂志采访。也能借此为下一场地方公演做个很好的宣传……大家，就拜托了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1001_interviewer", "source_sha256": "8b6cf9d463f779c0de1ed866aab11cb8537ebb873ce1d2103ece6789aa61166f", "ja": "なるほど、新曲の披露ですか。\nでは今回の地方公演も、見逃せませんね！", "zh": "原来如此，是要演出新歌啊。\n那么这次的地方公演也不容错过呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "050848ac2c42e872de4000efeb151c51c5ece7216401baae30cb46f07f8253d8", "ja": "はい！　地方のごヒイキ様方にご満足いただけるよう、\n公演当日まで、精進を重ねていくつもりです！", "zh": "是的！为了让支持我们的各地贵宾们满意，我打算一直努力到公演当天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "5533f33abdcfb8d13eccffd4bad94feafe1cde01358536a3ff7ee3106aa65acb", "ja": "もちろん、いつものファンのみんなも遊びにきてね？\nわたしたち、待ってるから！", "zh": "当然，平时的粉丝大家也都要来玩哦？\n我们，会等着你们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "6fbbbc2386add1d616d8cc73e32aced221b3992b1e0a9badbcce7acec3df1280", "ja": "どうぞ楽しみにしててくださいね。みなさんの\n期待を裏切るつもりはありませんから……ふふっ。", "zh": "请大家敬请期待。我们可没有打算辜负大家的期待……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1005_staff", "source_sha256": "97f6e56e1fc466a31446c64f88f6d465040a6c4253f9d68161868120364b722a", "ja": "インタビュー終了です、ありがとうございました！\n続いてグラビア撮影の方、お願いします。", "zh": "采访结束了，谢谢！\n接下来要进行写真拍摄，拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1006_se", "source_sha256": "a406702c593b538f561019f84c9c1ae8236074eb413e4e51ac2fd94a04a4d171", "ja": "パシャ！　パシャパシャ！", "zh": "咔嚓！咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1007_camman", "source_sha256": "e242edb5146e8c8d4cb82fde9104a131880cfe0f68ade0c62924d89e0b1ec884", "ja": "いいですね！　じゃあ次は、もう少し\n大人っぽく、アダルティな感じでお願いします！", "zh": "很好！那么接下来，请再成熟一点，带点成人风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "6788065f8d8fbd2031b0458a7b17413139cbd035fba75c8da98ef0f966c19fd4", "ja": "は、はい……！　お、大人な感じ……？\nえ、えっと、こう……ですか？", "zh": "是、是的……！成、成熟一点的感觉……？\n呃、呃……像这样……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "3fd3893eb6b1e566620fddbbf88407d96d5f7f9a068949bb3aa7fa3a238f4e37", "ja": "大人っぽくですね、えっと……。\nこんな感じで、どうでしょうか～？", "zh": "要显得成熟一点是吧，那个……\n这样感觉怎么样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1010_camman", "source_sha256": "861f44ed938e319bad4a5e02dbdf5a84a880bfd697b50b1e69bf1f321a073085", "ja": "三浦さん、バッチリです！\n篠宮さん、もう少しセクシーにお願いできますか？", "zh": "三浦小姐，完美！\n篠宫小姐，能请您再性感一点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "5486d7fef2d720a106f6b39adae728fed638b162c7eaaea196aa8124d89c96ea", "ja": "ええっ！？\nせ、セクシーと言われても、わ、私……。", "zh": "诶诶！？\n就、就算让我性感一点，可、可是我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "723530bbeede0dff533bf9f2b0b9099bd103d74177439849ea2c881b3aec7985", "ja": "可憐ちゃん、緊張しなくても大丈夫よ。\nそうね、ポーズを少し変えてみて……。", "zh": "可怜，不用紧张也可以的哦。\n让我想想，稍微换一下姿势看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "a5c26c5d3839a8d1077bf0aa6a386bad104faa4f04a9bfee65c05c893195ae24", "ja": "は、はい……あずささん、ありがとうございます……。\nえっと……うぅ、やっぱり、私には無理です……。", "zh": "好、好的……梓小姐，谢谢您……。\n那个……呜，果然我还是做不到……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cea5b3fc71b5bc11a27fcfd5145c58683582b4d3926bee857e2046cc97537ce3", "ja": "（可憐、完全に萎縮してしまっているな……\nここはいったん止めて、いやでも……）", "zh": "（可怜已经完全畏缩起来了……还是先暂停一下吧，不对，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "64071e0e718edac20b261256c536a5022d4be4fae255971b042078cb7ab35c71", "ja": "カメラマンさん、すみません！\nちょっといいですか？", "zh": "摄影师先生，不好意思！\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "85c9014e470ea55f5398046b8a5bd3f9303f12c60219dd0355a997e869ce99e1", "ja": "可憐はすごい美人なんですけど、見た目と違って\n大胆なポーズとかあまり得意じゃないんです。", "zh": "可怜虽然是个大美人，但和外表不同，\n其实不太擅长摆大胆的姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "da5dc8d182d6ac96789bd43ff92295445160882e4ef6a76c9c92ce7bbe383263", "ja": "でも、今回は育やエミリーも一緒ですし。\nせっかくですから、初々しさも狙ってみませんか？", "zh": "不过，这次育和艾米莉也会一起参加。\n难得有这个机会，不如也试试走青涩的路线？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1018_camman", "source_sha256": "a7b7fe1d46d13868bc13a7cd53676afd8bd6c7c45c4ddbba64553d81f2c2349b", "ja": "なるほど、ギャップですね……わかりました！\nじゃあ、そのコンセプトでもう一度……。", "zh": "原来如此，是反差啊……明白了！\n那么，就按照这个概念，再来一次……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cdc517fd5de450c4d97ea8839523b0cabcdf3df822e2f96f5646b4ce57f3d425", "ja": "助かったよ、律子。\nフォローを入れてくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "帮大忙了，律子。\n谢谢你帮我解围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "e7f50c19cd3499bddd3180f9fefebcfdec99f81ec7ffd84cac3b0578934e670e", "ja": "いえいえ、あれくらいは別に。\nでも、止めない方がよかったかもしれませんね。", "zh": "不客气，那种程度根本不算什么啦。\n不过，也许不去阻止反而更好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "bc54fde50fdd5223a39aed20218144cad22f17f79925e6e0fc78da31e1153827", "ja": "可憐には、もうちょっと自信をつけてもらわないと。\nせっかくのスタイルがもったいないわ。", "zh": "可怜她啊，还是得多树立一点自信才行。\n那么好的身材，可就太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ec71b2975d617a14fee78ca1f636d6f34e3fcb755d6cb82d5cdfec6c38702247", "ja": "気持ちは、わかるけど……。\n律子がそれを言うのか？", "zh": "我明白你的心情，不过……  \n这话由律子来说合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "702c40142ecb04d5839574bb3389bad546bf2c0d3a5144fbc4ffcc2ab594c417", "ja": "なんですか？　{$P$}。\n私は自分のことくらい、ちゃんとわかってますよ。", "zh": "怎么了？　{$P$}。\n我还是很了解自己的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0b913831053330b0de1c66178d4b90789daa23173f1107a0f20532b08e1c1a9a", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうかなぁ……。", "zh": "诶。是、是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "b9313a69540fe57576846410dd4cb5c483a3b6bb9b25261c6b0eda1d20002a60", "ja": "それより、夕方ってレッスンルーム空いてますよね？\n可憐に個人レッスンしたいんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "比起那个，傍晚的练习室是空着的吧？\n我想给可怜单独辅导，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "aa7953dda7a1aa97ab19519f557f759c6bad51dc49580ee1fbad71d89a1c25c5", "ja": "こ、個人レッスン……え……。\nり、律子さんが、私を指導してくれるんですか……！？", "zh": "个、个人练习……欸……  \n律子小姐要亲自指导我吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "5fcf01d7fd854dd4b88618f66cf315a64cbf82a0a03fc69738aab8b2eac20ff4", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。可憐は素材がいいんだから、\n今みたいに自信がないままじゃもったいないわ。", "zh": "嗯，是的。可怜的天赋很好，\n一直像现在这样缺乏自信就太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "923156662794a08988de2c9b3328b87f7b6b9a398c19d6d88c2c3bc1660e4f9a", "ja": "アイドルの自信は、とにかく積み重ねあるのみよ！\nまずは、ポージングの練習からね。", "zh": "偶像的自信，只有不断积累才能获得！\n先从姿势练习开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "f716e6a984c7427439d4f1b47c5cc82dffa9d7b0a09270a7fe6f2e20ef9496d5", "ja": "は、はい……！", "zh": "好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "5e972e734969f939bd1be79c77881d1a329f7635fe4ea421ad146c6608bcce9d", "ja": "それで可憐は、どういうところが苦手なの？\nポージングの方法がわからないとか？", "zh": "那么可怜，你具体是不擅长哪方面呢？\n比如不知道该怎么摆姿势之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "2a82fe6585b60ec889f74240873db65d29d91f82807e5500321c9b0b54245734", "ja": "えっと……ひ、人に見られると思うと、とても……\nき、緊張してしまって……。", "zh": "那个……一、一想到要被别人看着，就会特别……\n紧、紧张……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "cfbafe47428f60158740568f35bfbd4fb768ef14dc47a8d21e8a1b40d6a3b729", "ja": "人に見られると……って、根本的なところね……。\nそれも自信を持てれば変わってくるんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "一被人看到就……这可是根本问题呢……\n如果能建立起自信，应该也会有所改变吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "459e450a6accf87945f12edc23d410bd210448901fabb71a2197193eb308fa18", "ja": "変わる……。\nわ、私、変われる……でしょうか……？", "zh": "改变……\n我、我也能……有所改变吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "f0c169199efae680c939d017712b061be74e5e50dd8258b499a85fcfceab2a94", "ja": "ええ。レッスンに費やした時間は、裏切らないもの。\nしっかり身につければ、自信が持てるようになるわ。", "zh": "嗯。花在练习上的时间，是不会辜负你的。\n只要扎实掌握，就能逐渐拥有自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "85610e492c78966f22cd4721e3790d03c1831127dc4507186b8822e17eeae58f", "ja": "それじゃ可憐、私を見てマネしてね。\nまずは腰をこう、ぐぐっと……。", "zh": "那么可怜，看着我学哦。\n首先，腰要这样，用力——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "a8f5e010ff04c6656eb484487ffb19566070c304364c4a6e66d8227cd1065809", "ja": "こ、腰を……そんなに！？\nり、律子さん、だ、大胆……。", "zh": "腰、腰要……做到那种程度！？  \n律子小姐，真、真大胆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "3efe118cbb296abd0299e007ac8fbe3dad86352cd04909d9693b98809643b2f1", "ja": "あの、律子さん……き、今日はいろいろ、\nありがとうございました……！", "zh": "那个，律子姐……今、今天真的非常感谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "486428a3331d24f7050434ceab4172c2f4d4b1bbb4de6b211832c7f103519699", "ja": "わ、私……もうすこし、残って練習していきます……\n今日教えてもらったこと、おさらいしたいですし……。", "zh": "我、我……想再留下来练习一会儿……\n今天学到的东西，我也想好好复习一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "02cf934bb84e01ec6bc0f5edcd1a51caf4b2143d78e35a02bc173767fbb61b64", "ja": "それはダメよ、可憐。休むのも練習のうち。何度でも\n教えてあげるから、今日は帰ってちゃんと休みなさい。", "zh": "那可不行，可怜。休息也是练习的一部分。我会教你很多遍的，所以今天先回去好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "82def495b7662fd8c9003e93c217c0dd3cbb50356a1e8def301fb4520a0fc783", "ja": "律子さん……は、はいっ……♪", "zh": "律子小姐……好、好的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "c8223b422db736feab543b9bab5eee5750d3df34c80f6b586fe6646fe0069d33", "ja": "あれっ？　{$P$}、\nまだ帰ってなかったんですか？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，\n您还没回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "cd8cfa666dadb8ea520e28c9e69f1c13d21de7623b109bb724cf284ea3ec0cf8", "ja": "ちょっと、片付いてない仕事があって……\nそういう律子こそ、まだ残ってたのか？", "zh": "只是还有点工作没处理完……说起来，律子你才是，居然还没走啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "96981f5eb2eeb5673743bc5e52ff260758ecf55a8a1a23d5470a80b704ddb3ab", "ja": "もう、だから事務仕事は溜めないでくださいって\n言ったのに……仕方ないなぁ。手伝いますよ。", "zh": "真是的，我都跟您说过别把文书工作\n堆积起来了……真拿您没办法。我来帮您吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e1eab2b15ff256d5806ffd9722a9d62653150e441aab1f31275fa6a8a24bb495", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。それより律子も帰らないと。\n休むのも、練習のうちだろ？", "zh": "不用了，没关系。比起这个，律子你也该回去了。休息也是练习的一环，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "41e2d25ca598d217c4308a7f439dc8bf50394cdb158046935c954ccbc6ac7a2f", "ja": "私は大丈夫ですよ。今日はそんなに動いてないですし。\nさ、半分渡してください。", "zh": "我没事。今天也没怎么动。来，把一半给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "c483d9095f8813cf9eec9f307652f2ae1789f4bbe0a19a602e64605d81dfb714", "ja": "そうか……すまない。ありがとう。", "zh": "这样啊……抱歉。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1047_se", "source_sha256": "0713b4f30833bb3f2e4461dc9edb439f049cde0a9995ab402317091e61bdfbef", "ja": "ピコン♪", "zh": "叮咚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "dfb350f55e2fcaa61fac1ff52e1542bdfe7ffb9de9d729c75f77f60de9c776f4", "ja": "ん？　ああ、パソコンにメールが来たのか。\n……おっ、これは！！", "zh": "嗯？啊，电脑上收到邮件了吗。\n……哦，这是！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1049_009rit", "source_sha256": "298233ec55c546319f8c3b3964750c0cbd5c0b2e860529560358e2037682fcab", "ja": "どうしたんですか？\nまさか、書類の催促とかじゃないですよね？", "zh": "怎么了？\n该不会是来催文件的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "62995e7aec1113cf8391c55f95a76c35694e674e21581dae853cdac24b1dd6bd", "ja": "い、いや、違う違う。今度の地方公演用にってもらった\n新曲のデモが届いたんだ。ちょっと、聴いてみようか。", "zh": "不、不是，才不是。下次地方公演要用的新歌试听样带送到了。我们要不要先听听看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1052_009rit", "source_sha256": "274cfcaccade15ffb0dadcfd4458189b3f6078e3b890d270117a7b779449ca5f", "ja": "へえ、かわいい曲じゃないですか！　ちょっと\n切ないような感じもあって……ラブソングですか？", "zh": "诶，这不是首很可爱的歌吗！还有点淡淡的伤感……是情歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1053_009rit", "source_sha256": "a6dbdfece668276011a3163ad785e9ce3bc2bcf4aa57ea231d1f57272e0c40dc", "ja": "こういう曲調なら……うん、似合う子が何人か\n思い浮かんできますね。誰がいいかな……♪", "zh": "要是这种曲调……嗯，我脑海里已经浮现出几个适合的人选了。选谁好呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "79c0f16bf40a27c121520cc39a9400c843f932402e6b1c7b6faab4f9bc2e620b", "ja": "そうだな。個人的には律子にも、\n似合うんじゃないかと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。就我个人而言，我觉得律子应该也挺适合的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1055_009rit", "source_sha256": "10d99cd7088653df8f1a10f7a3d3a5dfaf1bf9042a4d871ee30628cdb4e86102", "ja": "もう……。はいはい、{$P$}。\n冗談が言えるなんて、ずいぶん余裕があるんですね？", "zh": "真是的……好啦好啦，{$P$}。\n还有心思开玩笑，看来你挺从容的嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1056_009rit", "source_sha256": "7cf78c963f8ff896eaab1740592c37a0cde287ec1438181eb7d7d9e29377a71c", "ja": "それじゃあ新曲のことはさておき、\nさっさと目の前の仕事、片付けちゃいましょう！", "zh": "那么新歌的事先放一边，赶紧把眼前的工作处理完吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "ebab59c6e7cd8cc04a2da23f61f5fcb8e9ca1ed824659f3671f63d36a011c2ca", "ja": "（うーん、冗談ではなかったんだけど……。\nまあ、この話はまた改めて、だな）", "zh": "（嗯——虽然我说的不是玩笑……\n不过，这件事还是之后再说吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
